# Earth Trial - Elemental Battle Cutscene
# Features grounded music, themes of endurance, and the Earth Elemental encounter

@backdrop textures/forest.gif [fadeIn=800]
@char HERO sprite=characters/male
@char EARTH_ELEMENTAL sprite=monsters/earth_elemental

@do playBgm [name=audio/jungle-rhythm.mp3]

wait 800

# The Earth Elemental awakens

*EARTH_ELEMENTAL: [cutin=size=large,expression=neutral]
"""
The ground trembles at my awakening...
I am the mountain. I am eternal.
"""

wait 600

HERO: [expression=neutral,position=left]
"""
Two shards already! The Earth trial is next.
"""

wait 500

EARTH_ELEMENTAL: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
Fire taught you passion.
Water taught you adaptation.
But do you have ENDURANCE?
"""

@do playSfx [name=audio/dungeon-beat.mp3]

wait 600

*HERO: [cutin=size=large,expression=smile]
"""
I've come this far!
Nothing will shake my resolve!
"""

wait 800

@transition wipe [duration=500]

wait 500

@backdrop textures/cave.gif [fadeIn=600]
@do playBgm [name=audio/sewer-beat.mp3]

# The test of endurance

EARTH_ELEMENTAL: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
My trial is not about winning.
It's about not losing.
Can you withstand... EVERYTHING?
"""

wait 600

HERO: [expression=tired,position=left]
"""
The weight... it's like carrying a mountain...
My body wants to collapse...
"""

wait 600

*EARTH_ELEMENTAL: [cutin=size=large,expression=neutral]
"""
Pain is temporary!
The weak crumble. The strong endure!
What are YOU?
"""

wait 600

HERO: [expression=worried,position=left]
"""
I... I... won't... FALL!
Every step... every breath...
I keep... moving... FORWARD!
"""

@do playSfx [name=audio/brass-loop.mp3]

wait 800

@transition fadeOutBackdrop [duration=500]

wait 500

@backdrop textures/forest.gif [fadeIn=600]
@do playBgm [name=audio/calm-escape.mp3]

# Victory

EARTH_ELEMENTAL: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
Still standing...
After all that pressure...
You have the soul of a mountain.
"""

wait 500

HERO: [expression=smile,position=left]
"""
I learned something important today.
True strength isn't about power.
It's about never giving up!
"""

*EARTH_ELEMENTAL: [cutin=size=large,expression=neutral]
"""
The Earth Shard recognizes your spirit.
Take it, and stand firm in your convictions.
One final trial awaits you...
"""

wait 800

@do playBgm [name=audio/dawns-peak.mp3]

@transition wipe [duration=700]

waitInput

@end
